      "Deploy an Application Load Balancer (ALB) and an Auto Scaling group of Amazon EC2 instances mounted to an Amazon Elastic File System (Amazon EFS) file system. Have students upload videos to EC2, and schedule an AWS DataSync task to transfer completed files to Amazon S3.",
