      "Store the records in an Amazon S3 Glacier Flexible Retrieval vault with a 7-year Glacier Vault Lock policy. Configure Amazon GuardDuty S3 Protection to inspect object contents and classify sensitive patient records.",
      "Enable S3 Versioning and MFA Delete on the bucket. Create a Service Control Policy (SCP) to deny the s3:DeleteObject permission for all principals. Configure AWS Config managed rules to inspect object payloads for sensitive health information."
