      "Deploy the application code onto Amazon EC2 instances within an Auto Scaling group behind a Network Load Balancer (NLB). Place an Amazon CloudFront distribution in front of the NLB to cache syllabus responses, and configure CloudFront Functions to throttle excess requests.",
