      "Deploy an Amazon CloudFront distribution with the existing ALB configured as the origin. Create an Auto Scaling group of Amazon EC2 instances behind the ALB, and configure target tracking scaling policies. Add a path-based routing rule on the ALB to forward /drops/* requests to the EC2 target group."
