      "Configure an AWS Site-to-Site VPN connection over the public internet between the on-premises data center and the AWS VPC. Deploy an Amazon RDS DB instance with an asynchronous Read Replica in a second Availability Zone to provide automated failover for reservation transactions. Deploy an AWS DataSync agent on-premises to continuously replicate document files from local NAS storage to an Amazon S3 bucket, and configure an S3 Lifecycle rule to transition objects to S3 Glacier Flexible Retrieval after 90 days.",
      "Establish an AWS Direct Connect connection between the on-premises data center and the AWS VPC. Deploy an Amazon RDS Multi-AZ DB instance with a synchronous standby replica for reservation transactions. Deploy an AWS Storage Gateway Volume Gateway in cached volume mode on-premises to present iSCSI block storage targets backed by Amazon EBS snapshots, and use AWS Backup to archive snapshots after 90 days."
