      "Store active player session data in Amazon DynamoDB configured with on-demand capacity mode. Enable DynamoDB Streams to capture match completion events and invoke an AWS Lambda function to process the results and write relational updates to an Amazon RDS PostgreSQL DB instance through Amazon RDS Proxy.",
