      "Deploy the containerized service on Amazon ECS using the AWS Fargate launch type. Specify an IAM role with Amazon S3 permissions in the ECS task role (taskRoleArn) parameter of the task definition. Configure the application to upload generated PDF files to a private Amazon S3 bucket and generate time-limited Amazon S3 presigned URLs for passenger downloads."
