      "Create an Amazon RDS cross-Region read replica in us-west-2. In us-west-2, pre-configure an Application Load Balancer and an Auto Scaling group referencing an Amazon Machine Image (AMI) copied from us-east-1, with the desired and minimum capacity set to 0. In the event of a disaster, promote the read replica to a standalone DB instance, scale out the Auto Scaling group to production capacity, and update DNS records using Amazon Route 53."
