      "Deploy an Amazon Elastic File System (Amazon EFS) file system configured with Elastic throughput. Use AWS DataSync to copy the required dataset from the Amazon S3 bucket to Amazon EFS before each training job, and create an AWS Lambda function to synchronize completed output results back to Amazon S3.",
