    question_en: "A regional airline operates an online flight booking platform that exports daily reservation transaction records and ticket modification logs in JSON format to an Amazon S3 bucket. The airline's business analytics team needs to perform ad-hoc SQL queries on this dataset to analyze seasonal booking trends and passenger fare selections. The schema of the JSON records evolves frequently as new ancillary services, promotional bundles, and partner codeshares are introduced. A solutions architect must design a solution that automatically detects schema modifications and allows the analytics team to query the data with the least operational overhead and cost.\n\nWhich solution meets these requirements?",
