      "Deploy an AWS Config multi-account aggregator in the AWS Organizations management account. Configure AWS Config to capture all IAM and API configuration changes across the organization and stream them to an Amazon EventBridge event bus connected to an Amazon S3 bucket. Apply an S3 bucket policy using the aws:PrincipalOrgID condition key.",
      "Configure an individual AWS CloudTrail multi-Region trail in each member account. Configure the trails to deliver logs to local Amazon S3 buckets, and configure Amazon S3 Cross-Region Replication (CRR) to replicate the log files to a central S3 bucket in a security account. Use local IAM policies in each member account to restrict trail modifications.",
