      "Order an AWS Direct Connect 1 Gbps connection to the VPC. Configure an S3 Gateway endpoint in the VPC route tables. Upload the archive files using standard single-part S3 PUT operations, and create an S3 Lifecycle rule to transition incomplete uploads to S3 Glacier Flexible Recovery.",
