      "Deploy a Network Load Balancer (NLB) across multiple Availability Zones. Subscribe to AWS Shield Advanced and associate it with the NLB to access the AWS Shield Response Team (SRT) and receive DDoS cost protection. Use an AWS Lambda authorizer to inspect and route requests based on the URL path."
