      "Deploy an Amazon RDS Multi-AZ DB instance with Read Replicas to offload flight search queries, and deploy an Amazon RDS Proxy to pool database connections during traffic spikes. Store generated PDF boarding passes in an Amazon S3 bucket and generate Amazon S3 presigned URLs for passengers to download them directly.",
