      "Deploy an AWS Global Accelerator in front of the Application Load Balancer (ALB) for dynamic API routing. Enable S3 Cross-Region Replication (CRR) to replicate static assets to buckets in Europe and Asia, and use Amazon Route 53 latency-based routing to direct users to the nearest bucket.",
      "Create an Amazon CloudFront distribution with multiple origins. Configure the Amazon S3 bucket as the default origin for static assets using Origin Access Control (OAC), and configure an Application Load Balancer (ALB) as the origin for dynamic `/records/*` and `/appointments/*` API path patterns. Route all user traffic through CloudFront."
