      "Store configuration parameters and encrypted credentials as SecureString parameters in AWS Systems Manager Parameter Store. Configure an Amazon EventBridge rule to capture Parameter Store update events and invoke an AWS Lambda function to validate the payload. Have the Lambda function use AWS Systems Manager Run Command to execute a configuration reload script on the EC2 instances via the SSM Agent.",
      "Store the route pricing matrices and encrypted payment credentials in Amazon S3. Configure an S3 event notification to trigger an AWS Lambda function when an object is updated. Have the Lambda function trigger an Auto Scaling instance refresh to terminate and replace all EC2 instances in the Auto Scaling group so that new User Data scripts can apply the updated configuration.",
