      "Install and configure the unified Amazon CloudWatch agent on the EC2 instances to publish memory utilization metrics. Create an Amazon CloudWatch alarm that triggers when memory utilization exceeds 85%. Configure an Amazon EventBridge rule for the alarm state change to invoke an AWS Lambda function that executes an AWS Systems Manager Run Command document to restart the ingestion daemon and publish an alert to an Amazon Simple Notification Service (Amazon SNS) topic."
