      "Apply an Amazon S3 bucket policy with an explicit Deny statement for s3:DeleteObject and s3:PutObject actions for all IAM users and roles.",
      "Configure an S3 Lifecycle rule to transition objects from S3 Standard to S3 Glacier Instant Retrieval after 30 days, and to S3 Glacier Deep Archive after 365 days.",
      "Enable Amazon S3 Object Lock on the bucket and configure a default retention period of 7 years in Compliance mode."
