      "Ingest the data into an Amazon OpenSearch Service cluster using Amazon Kinesis Data Firehose. Configure OpenSearch Dashboards for visual reporting, and write custom AWS Lambda functions to modify index mappings for schema changes.",
      "Configure an AWS Glue crawler to automatically discover schemas and update the AWS Glue Data Catalog. Use Amazon Athena to query the data from Amazon S3, and build interactive dashboards using Amazon QuickSight."
