    question_en: "A regional airline operates a ticket booking platform where flight confirmation PDF documents are stored in an Amazon S3 bucket immediately after purchase. The airline wants to automatically process each uploaded PDF to extract itinerary details and send real-time confirmation SMS notifications to passengers. The document processing takes approximately 5 seconds per file. The booking volume fluctuates dramatically, with high peaks during holiday fare sales and long periods of low activity overnight.\n\nA solutions architect must design a solution that meets these requirements with the LEAST operational overhead.\n\nWhich solution meets these requirements?",
