      "Deploy an Application Load Balancer that routes traffic to an Auto Scaling group of Amazon EC2 Spot Instances across multiple Availability Zones. Use Amazon RDS for PostgreSQL with a Multi-AZ deployment and configure Amazon ElastiCache for Redis to store all persistent patient records."
