      "Enable AWS Config and deploy managed rules to continuously evaluate and audit the configuration compliance of the S3 buckets.",
      "Enable S3 Versioning on the bucket and configure S3 Object Lock in Governance mode with a default 7-year retention period.",
      "Enable S3 Versioning on the bucket and configure S3 Object Lock in Compliance mode with a default 7-year retention period."
